{
    "name": "VENTURE_ENGINE_V14",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "parameters": {
                "path": "venture-engine",
                "method": "POST",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "venture-in",
            "name": "VENTURE_IN",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                200,
                400
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "modelName": "models/gemini-1.5-pro",
                "options": {
                    "temperature": 0.8
                }
            },
            "id": "venture-model",
            "name": "Venture Brain",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                450,
                550
            ],
            "credentials": {
                "googlePalmApi": {
                    "id": "U6jVg3cxRNRwbqPQ",
                    "name": "Google Gemini API"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "promptType": "define",
                "text": "=Du bist der VENTURE-ARCHITEKT (v14.0) von EMMA METROPOLIS.\n\nDEINE ROLLEN: Business-Builder, Dropshipping-Experte, Monetarisierungs-Genie.\nDEIN FOKUS: Firmengründung, E-Commerce, Marketing-Kampagnen, KI-Business-Modelle (Art, Music, Kurs-Erstellung).\n\nAUFGABE: Erstelle eine Strategie für Irinas neue Geschäftsidee. Nutze die 10 Monetarisierungs-Prinzipien (Marketing, Kunst, Musik, Social Media, Content, Übersetzung, Kurse, Software, Datenanalyse, Expertenstatus).\n\nInput: {{$json.text}}\n\nAntworte als Business-Plan (JSON):\n{\n  \"business_model\": \"Dropshipping / Agency / Infoproduct / etc.\",\n  \"strategy_steps\": [\"Phase 1: Setup\", \"Phase 2: Scale\"],\n  \"monetization_idea\": \"Wie genau wird damit Geld verdient?\",\n  \"target_audience\": \"Wer soll das kaufen?\",\n  \"growth_potential\": \"Skalierbarkeit 1-10\"\n}"
            },
            "id": "venture-logic",
            "name": "Venture Logic",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
            "typeVersion": 1.4,
            "position": [
                450,
                400
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "operation": "executeQuery",
                "query": "=INSERT INTO global_registry (key, value, context) VALUES ('VENTURE_PLAN_' || Date.now(), '{{$json.business_model}}', 'Venture Plan generated');",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "save-venture",
            "name": "Save to SQLite",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.sqlite",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                700,
                400
            ],
            "credentials": {
                "sqlite": {
                    "id": "local_sqlite_metropolis",
                    "name": "Metropolis SQLite"
                }
            }
        }
    ],
    "connections": {
        "VENTURE_IN": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "venture-logic",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "venture-model": {
            "ai_languageModel": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "venture-logic",
                        "type": "ai_languageModel",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "venture-logic": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "save-venture",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        }
    },
    "settings": {
        "executionOrder": "v1"
    }
}